<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive"><title>가을 공동체 여행 공동편집 · 에코디선교회</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/ekodimission/assets/site.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/ekodimission/assets/shell.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/ekodimission/assets/collab.css"><script src="/ekodimission/assets/shell.js" defer></script><script src="/ekodimission/assets/collab.js" defer></script></head><body>
<header class="mission-site-header"><a class="mission-brand" href="/ekodimission"><span class="mission-brand-mark">E</span><span><strong>에코디선교회</strong><small>EKODI MISSION</small></span></a><nav aria-label="주요 메뉴" data-mission-nav></nav></header>
<main class="collab-page" data-collab-editor>
<section class="collab-head"><p class="eyebrow">SHARED EDIT · PRIVATE LINK</p><h1>2026 가을 공동체 여행 공동편집</h1><p>링크를 가진 편집자가 함께 계획을 다듬을 수 있습니다. 초안은 자동 저장되며, 게시 권한 링크에서만 홈페이지에 반영할 수 있습니다.</p><div class="collab-status-row"><span data-connection-state>연결 확인 중</span><span data-revision-state>버전 확인 중</span><span data-publish-state></span></div></section>
<section class="collab-name"><label><span>편집자 이름</span><input data-editor-name maxlength="80" placeholder="이름 또는 닉네임"></label><p>변경이력에 표시됩니다.</p></section>
<form class="collab-form" data-collab-form>
<div class="collab-grid">
<label class="wide"><span>행사명</span><input name="title" maxlength="120"></label>
<label class="wide"><span>주제</span><input name="theme" maxlength="160"></label>
<label class="wide"><span>소개</span><textarea name="summary" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
<label><span>모집 인원</span><input name="capacity" type="number" min="1" max="100"></label>
<label><span>참가비(원)</span><input name="fee_krw" type="number" min="0" step="1000"></label>
<label class="wide"><span>추가비용 안내</span><input name="fee_note" maxlength="300"></label>
<label><span>출발</span><input name="departure" maxlength="200"></label>
<label><span>복귀</span><input name="return" maxlength="200"></label>
<label class="wide"><span>예배</span><input name="worship" maxlength="200"></label>
<label class="wide"><span>10월 3일 일정</span><textarea name="schedule_1" rows="3" maxlength="1500"></textarea></label>
<label class="wide"><span>10월 4일 일정</span><textarea name="schedule_2" rows="3" maxlength="1500"></textarea></label>
<label class="wide"><span>숙소 1순위</span><textarea name="lodging_1" rows="2" maxlength="800"></textarea></label>
<label class="wide"><span>숙소 2순위</span><textarea name="lodging_2" rows="2" maxlength="800"></textarea></label>
<label class="wide"><span>추가 안내</span><textarea name="notice" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
</div>
<div class="collab-actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-reload>최신본 불러오기</button><a class="button secondary" href="/ekodimission/apply/261003-autumn-trip" target="_blank" rel="noopener">홈페이지 미리보기</a><button type="button" class="button primary" data-publish hidden>홈페이지에 게시</button></div>
<p class="collab-save" data-save-state aria-live="polite">초안을 불러오는 중입니다.</p>
</form>
<section class="collab-history"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">CHANGE HISTORY</p><h2>최근 변경</h2></div><ol data-history-list><li>불러오는 중…</li></ol></section>
</main></body></html>